{
  "id": "sigf/ultracraft",
  "version": "0.1.4",
  "name": "Ultracraft",
  "tagline": "The real ULTRAKILL inside Minecraft 1.21.11: become V1 in your Minecraft world, with ULTRAKILL's weapons, enemies, shop, P-rank and the Cyber Grind.",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Become V1 in your Minecraft world: a hidden ULTRAKILL turns its blocks and mobs into ULTRAKILL's enemies and world, with P-rank, a shop and the Cyber Grind.",
    "Have Steam running, then press Play: Minecraft starts and ULTRAKILL starts by itself, hidden. Do not start ULTRAKILL yourself. Open a world and you are V1.",
    "WASD, Space jump, Left Shift dash, Left Ctrl slide/slam, mouse fire/alt fire, F punch, G change arm, R whiplash, E next variation, 1-5 weapons.",
    "F8 switches V1/Steve, V guns/Minecraft hands. Settings and rebinds: the Ultracraft... button (title screen, pause menu). Commands: /uc help.",
    "Craft the shop from 5 iron ingots, 2 gold ingots, a glass pane and a block of redstone; walk up as V1 to spend P. The Cyber Grind starts from its screen."
  ],
  "kind": "passthrough",
