  "notes": [
    "You need ULTRAKILL on Steam and Minecraft: Java Edition; Windows only. ULTRAKILL closes with Minecraft. The Cyber Grind is waves of enemies around the shop.",
    "Two games share your graphics card: if it is slow, set ULTRAKILL Resolution to 540p or 480p in Ultracraft... settings and keep Minecraft render distance at 8-12 chunks. Your ULTRAKILL save is never written. Multiplayer is Open to LAN, everyone with the same mods.",
    "Beta with open bug reports (V1 not appearing, ULTRAKILL not opening, rendering). BepInEx and the bridge plugin go into the ULTRAKILL folder; Restore removes them. Report bugs to the author on the upstream issue tracker."
  ]
